  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizagi balondeeji bane gīt'ūmo nū nene nalī nondeeji wa ng'wa Kilisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkundīkīja ntwe ikanza lya kūlamya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmukumīlīja īkī mukūnizūkagwa mu yose, nīyo na a malange ayo nakang'winha mugadimile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike natogilwe mumane gīkī ū Kilisito alī ntwe gwa būlī ngosha, al'ū ntwe gwa nkīma ng'wene ngosha, hama ū ntwe go ng'wa Kilisito alī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ngosha ūlū alīlomba nūūlū alīhanga alīyo ū ntwe gokwe gūkundīkīgije, akūbiza alīgūgoola ū ntwe gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī nkīma ūlū alīlomba, nūūlū alīhanga ū ntwe gokwe gūbiza gūtakundīkīgije, ū ng'wene akūbiza alīgūgoola ū ntwe gokwe, ū mu gīko akūbiza atikīlile nū yūyo amoogilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nkīma ūlū atagūkundīkīgije ū ntwe gokwe ni asūnzūūlagwe ī nzwīlī jakwe, alīyo ūlū alībona minala ū kūjisūnzūūla ī nzwīlī jakwe nūūlū kūjimooga, ni agūkundīkījage ū ntwe gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ū ng'wene atigeleelilwe ū kūgūkundīkīja ū ntwe gokwe, nguno alī būlolelo n'ikūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu, alīyo ū nkīma ū ng'wene alī ikūjo lya ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ū ngosha atafumile mulī nkīma; ū nkīma h'ūyo afumile mulī ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū ngosha ataseemilwe kūlwa nkīma; ū nkīma h'ūyo akaseeng'wa kūlwa ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū kūlwa nguno yenīyī, na kūlwa nguno ya bamalaika, shing'wigelile ū nkīma ooleche ū kū ntwe būlolelo bo kūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nahene ū mulī Seeba atīho ngosha ūlū atīho nkīma, hama atīho nkīma ūlū atīho ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gīt'ūmo nkīma afumile mulī ngosha, h'ūmo īlī nū kūlī ngosha; nang'hwe akabyalagwa na nkīma, alīyo ī shose shifumile kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū a bing'we benekīlī lamulagi, mulībona ībeelelile ū nkīma anombe ū Mulungu alīyo atagūkundīkīgije ū ntwe gwakwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, a kabūmbīlwe nako katoolekejaga gīkī gūlī gwa soni ū ngosha ūlū ūbiza na nzwīlī ndīhu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ū nkīma ūlū ūbiza na nzwīlī ndīhu, līl'ikūjo ū kūlī we. Nguno ū nkīma akinhwa nzwīlī ndīhu ja kūnkundīkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū alīho ose ose ūyo atogilwe halalī, a bise tūtī na shīmīle shilī gīko, nūūlū nī kanisa ja ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwīkūja sangīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu mhayo ūyū, ū gwene natūmukumīlījaga. Nguno ū kwibilinga kwing'we kūtī na solobo yose yose, ūlū ītī kwiyingīja mu makoye dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ī soolo ya mhayo naliigwa gīkī, ūlū ng'wibilingaga ū mu kanisa mukūbizaga na wisolanhya; nū nene nalīīta nagūzunya ū mhayo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno shiigelile būbize ho dūhū ū wikīla kīji ū mu mhayo gwenūyo, hū bakūmanīka hape abo banukūlīlwe ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya a bing'we ūlū ng'wibilinga, mutibilingaga kūlwa shilīwa sha ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene akūlyaga shakwe dūhū, būtīho ū wilindīīji nūūlū hado, nose ūngī ashikile kūbiza atuubile, alīyo ūngī akūbbīzūkaga ndoso dūhū, okaleebagwa na kūleewa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutī najo ī kaya ja kwigasha ng'walya na kūng'wa kwenūko? Nūūlū hamo mukwīdalahaga ī kanisa ya ng'wa Mulungu, nose mukūbizaga na ng'hūmbū ja kūbadimya minala abo batī na shikolo? Ī gīsī namukumīlīje, nūūlū namuwīle mhayo kī? Ū mu mhayo gwenūyū natūdūla ū kūmukumīlīja!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtūūlwa sangīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno īyo nakanukūla kūfuma kūlī Seeba h'īyo nane nakang'winha a bing'we; gīkī, ū Seeba Yesu akasola ngatī ū mu būjikū ūbo akalodeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho walūmba ūgūmeganya; hūna ūhaya gīkī, “Ū gwenūyū gūlī mīlī gwane kūlwa nguno ying'we, mulīītage gīko kūlwa kūnizūkwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūmala ū kūlya, wīta gīko nī shikombe; nasho ūbinha kūnū alīhaya, “Ī shikombe īshi shilī ilagane ipya mu mininga gane, mulīītage gīkī gwa ūlū mulīng'wa kūlwa kūnizūkwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ikanza ūlū mulīgūlya ū ngatī gwenūyū, nūūlū mulīshing'wa ī shikombe shenīshi, mukūkūkumūchaga ū kūcha kwa ng'wa Seeba kūshisha ize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya būlī ng'wene ūyo ūgūlya ū ngatī, nūūlū ūshing'wa ī shikombe sha ng'wa Seeba mu mbika īyo ītigeleelilwe, akūbiza mu kwihīga kūlwa nguno ya mīlī go ng'wa Seeba na mininga gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī munhū ni igīsīlījage wei ng'wenekīlī hūna agūlye ū ngatī, nī shikombe ashing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūyo akūlyaga na kūng'wa mu būtūgūdīlīla ū mīlī gwa ng'wa Seeba, ū ng'wenūyo akūlyaga na kūng'wa nsango gokwe wei ng'wenekīlī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene bingī ū mu bing'we balī bagokolo na basedeeku, na bangī bakūchaaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ni twalī twihūgūla bise benekīlī, ni twaleka ū kūlamulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Seeba ūlū ūtūlamula numho alītūhūgūla gīkī tūtizūlamulwa hamò na banhū ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū badūgū bane, ūlū ng'wibilingaga kūlya shilīwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeba, ng'wilindīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū munhū atuubile ni alīīlage kū kaya, yaya ū kwibilinga kūlwa kūgwa mu nsango; ī yīngī nakwīgolanya ūlū nalize ko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
